# Git & Documentation
.git
.gitignore
.vs
.vscode
Docs/
*.md

# Build Artifacts & Dependencies (Crucial: Let Docker compile fresh inside Linux)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
**/publish-web/
**/publish-api/
**/release-web/
**/release-api/

# Environment files & Secrets (Never bake secrets into images)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test results & logs
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/*.log
